--
N5008 [class.virtual]/2: a virtual function newly introduced by a derived class
must be dispatched correctly.  Regression test for the vtable dispatch bug that
selected the first vtable pointer (a base's) instead of the one whose vtable
contains the called function, failing with "member 'virtual_table::...' not
found".  Blocked CBMC's own messaget/typecheckt hierarchy (ui_message.cpp,
cout_message.cpp).
